pentax-shader-compiler is a modified Rust adaptation of portions of
KytyPS5-Performance, not an independent implementation of those portions.

Source project: https://github.com/WerrySs/KytyPS5-Performance
Pinned source: 209dffe9032d72749257ce18680d506b891284de
Upstream project: https://github.com/KytyPS5/KytyPS5

Adapted files under src/graphics/shader/recompiler/:
  frontend/decode/ShaderDecoder.cpp: DecodeProgram termination rules.
  frontend/cfg/ShaderCFG.{h,cpp}: checked direct graph construction,
    dominators/post-dominators, natural loops, components and structurization.
  frontend/translate/{Translator.h,Translate.cpp,Dispatch.cpp,Scalar.cpp,
    Vector.cpp,Integer.cpp,Float.cpp,Convert.cpp,Compare.cpp,Control.cpp,
    Memory.cpp,Attribute.cpp}: operand and stage entry handling and the
    supported scalar/vector/control/buffer/interpolation/export lowerings.
  ir/{ShaderIR.h,Value.h,Value.cpp,Type.h,Reg.h,Block.h,IREmitter.h,
    IREmitter.cpp,opcodes/ValueOpcodes.inc}: the typed IR subset and emitter.
  ir/passes/{SsaRewrite.cpp,ConstantPropagation.cpp,DeadCodeElimination.cpp,
    ResourceTracking.cpp,ShaderInfoCollection.cpp,BindingLayout.cpp}:
    SSA, folding, liveness, direct buffer tracking and interface/binding layout.
  backend/spirv/{SpirvBuilder.h,SpirvBuilder.cpp,SpirvEmitter.cpp,
    spirvEmitterModule.cpp,spirvEmitterProgram.cpp,spirvEmitterInstructions.h,
    spirvEmitterAlu.cpp,spirvEmitterAluHelpers.cpp,spirvEmitterFlow.cpp,
    spirvEmitterMemory.cpp,spirvEmitterMemoryHelpers.cpp}:
    supported binary module, control, ALU, interface and buffer emission.
  ShaderRecompiler.h and CodegenOptions.h: typed compile fields and defaults.
Additional source vocabulary: src/graphics/shader/shader.h and shaderBindings.h.
This inventory describes adapted portions, not whole-file feature parity.

