same monotonic compiler budget through exact buffer specialization, resource
tracking and emission. Descriptor source recognition reuses the existing
ResourceTracking.cpp adaptation at the pinned revision above. There are no
guest-memory callbacks, alternative entry defaults or new source dependencies.
